OL,3,GNEWSATwo men dead after glider crashes 
OL,4,Ainto Loch Leven                        
OL,6,FTwo men have died after a glider       
OL,7,Fcrashed into Loch Leven.               
OL,9,FPolice, ambulance, fire service and the
OL,10,Fcoastguard were called to the scene    
OL,11,Fnear Kinross at about 11:00.           
OL,13,FThe Scottish Gliding Centre, which is  
OL,14,Fbased at Portmoak Airfield near the    
OL,15,Floch, said a two-seater Perkoz aircraft
OL,16,Fhad "crashed whilst on a local training
OL,17,Fflight" but it was not clear what had  
OL,18,Fcaused the crash.                      
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
